@prefix s2a: <https://ggen.dev/packs/sa2a-fastapi#> .
# s2a:/s2b: composition decision (recorded 2026-09-22, GGMKT-26922-07).
#
# sa2a-fastapi-pack (this vocabulary, s2a:) and sa2a-bridge-pack (s2b:) are
# deliberately disjoint transport projections of the same SA2A calculus, not
# duplicates, and do not compose into one surface:
# - s2b: models the BEAM-port edge chain (one s2b:EdgeSpec per port op, the
#   exactly-one-DO law, SHA-pinned supplier identity) and composes
#   elixir-mcp-a2a-pack's ema:Capability for MCP/A2A discoverability.
# - s2a: models the Python/FastAPI HTTP gateway surface over
#   protocol-integration-pack's pi:Capability individuals; its closed scope
#   vocabularies (none/idempotent/consequential, none/read_only/read_write,
#   none/logged/sealed_receipt) mirror the ema: descriptor contract's value
#   sets by design, but no s2a: individual is an ema: or s2b: individual.
# Composition would conflate s2b's port DO boundary (which requires fresh
# operator authority) with an HTTP read surface that must never reach it.
# The two packs share semantics only through SA2A's own public vocabulary.
@prefix pi: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/protocol-integration#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

s2a:FastAPISA2ASurface a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "A generated SA2A HTTP surface over one or more already-defined pi:Capability individuals." .

s2a:CapabilityProjection a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:comment "Protocol-specific metadata for projecting an existing capability without redefining its semantics." .

s2a:surfaceName a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:FastAPISA2ASurface ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
s2a:mountPath a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:FastAPISA2ASurface ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
s2a:containsProjection a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:FastAPISA2ASurface ; rdfs:range s2a:CapabilityProjection .
s2a:projectsCapability a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:CapabilityProjection ; rdfs:range pi:Capability .
s2a:capabilityId a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:CapabilityProjection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
s2a:observationScope a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:CapabilityProjection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
s2a:mutationScope a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:CapabilityProjection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
s2a:requiresAuthority a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:CapabilityProjection ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean .
s2a:receiptSemantics a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain s2a:CapabilityProjection ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
